sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Redis as Redis

    Client->>API: Request API endpoint
    API->>Redis: INCR rate:ip:1.2.3.4
    Redis->>API: Count = 1
    API->>Redis: EXPIRE rate:ip:1.2.3.4 60
    API->>Client: Response 200 OK

    Client->>API: Another request
    API->>Redis: INCR rate:ip:1.2.3.4
    Redis->>API: Count = 2
    API->>Client: Response 200 OK

    Note over Client,Redis: Many more requests...

    Client->>API: Request when limit reached
    API->>Redis: INCR rate:ip:1.2.3.4
    Redis->>API: Count = 101
    API->>Client: Response 429 Too Many Requests